{"id":"word:hebrew:H268","type":"word","title":"אָחוֹר","subtitle":"H268 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"the hinder part; hence (adverb) behind , backward ; also (as facing north) the West","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אָחוֹר (H268) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 41 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אָחוֹר (ʼâchôwr) means the hinder part; hence (adverb) behind , backward ; also (as facing north) the West First listed occurrence: 1Chr 19 10."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אָחוֹר","transliteration":"ʼâchôwr","pronunciation":"aw-khore'","strong":"H268","lemmaId":"hebrew:H268","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["אָח֑וֹר","אָחֽוֹר","אָח֣וֹר","אָ֭חוֹר","אָחוֹר֙"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",24],["HR/Ncmsa",7],["HC/Ncmsa",4],["HNcmpc/Sp3mp",3],["HC/R/Ncmsa",1],["HR",1],["HNcmpc/Sp1cs",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"the hinder part; hence (adverb) behind , backward ; also (as facing north) the West","usage":"after(-ward), back (part, -side, -ward), hereafter, (be-) hind(-er part), time to come, without.","full":"H268. achor אָחוֺר 41 substantive (Arabic ) the hinder side, back part , in the singular, mostly in adverbial phrases: — a. as accusative, in poetry backwards 23t. ( = prose אֲחֹרַנִּית ) with verbs such as נָפַל fall Gen 49:17 , נָשׂוֺג be turned 2Sam 1:22 (|| רֵיקָם תָּשׁוּב ), שׁוּב Psa 9:4 ; 56:10 +, נָסוֺג 35:4 ; 40:15 + (of enemies repulsed), 44:19 ; Isa 50:5 (from obedience to God), נָזוֺר 1:4 , הֵשׁיב 44:25 ; Psa 44:11 , הִכָּה 78:66 ; behind (opposed to קֶדֶם ) 139:5 ; Job 23:8 ; in the phrase וְאָחוֺר מָּנִים in front and behind 1Chr 19:10 (altered from ׳מִמָּ ׳וּמֵאָ in 2Samuel see below) 2Chr 13:14 ; Ezek 2:10 . b. בְּאָחוֺר Prov 29:11 , יְשַׁבְּחֶנָּה בְּאָחוֺר וְחָכָם Ges Hi but a wise man stilleth it ( רוּחַ anger) backwards (that is, when it would break forth), De in the background , that is, of his heart (|| כְסִיל יוֺצִיא כָּלרֿוּחוֺ ). c. לְאָחוֺר ( α ) as a. Psa 114:3 ; 114:5 ; Jer 7:24 ; ( β ) of time, hereafter (compare לְפָנִים = before) Isa 41:23 ; 42:23 . d. מֵאָחוֺר behind ( מן = on the side of) 2Sam 10:9 וּמֵ ׳מִמָּנִים in front and behind , Isa 9:11 מֵאָ ׳וּפְלִשְׁתִּים and the Philistines behind (= on the West), opposed to מִקֶּדֶם אֲרָם . Plur. construct אֲחֹרֵי hinder part (of the tabernacle) Exod 26:12 , (of a man or animal 33:23 ; 1Kin 7:25 (= 2Chr 4:4 ) Ezek 8:16 .","rootNote":"or (shortened) אָחֹר ; from 299 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 19 10","keyReferences":["1Chr 19 10","1Kgs 7 25","2Chr 4 4","2Chr 13 14","2Sam 1 22","2Sam 10 9","Exod 26 12","Exod 33 23"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":41,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 19 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":19,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אָח֑וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 25","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲחֹֽרֵי/הֶ֖ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 4 4","book":"2Chr","chapter":4,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲחֹרֵי/הֶ֖ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 13 14","book":"2Chr","chapter":13,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אָח֔וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 1 22","book":"2Sam","chapter":1,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָח֑וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 10 9","book":"2Sam","chapter":10,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מֵֽ/אָח֑וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 26 12","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲחֹרֵ֥י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR"},{"reference":"Exod 33 23","book":"Exod","chapter":33,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲחֹרָ֑/י","source":"heb